Hi all,

I'm proud to present a new pair of activities that allows us to model a rollercoaster process: batch and separate. These are basically the antithesis of clone/synchronize, and the four of them cover all the features of Arena's batch/separate blocks with further improvements.

See #45 <https://github.com/r-simmer/simmer/issues/45> for more details and check out the master branch if you wish to test them.

